    {
      "ref": "rfinding-005",
      "kind": "observation",
      "safe_neutral_synthesis": "Short campaigns are built around replay and higher-level challenge objectives, a compelling loop for enthusiasts but monotonous to players who want new content rather than repeated stages.",
